# Keep build-required paths uploadable; exclude heavy/churn data from deployment storage.
# NOTE: every script invoked by `npm run build` must live under src/scripts/ (uploaded).
# A previous version excluded research/ via negation and Vercel ignored the negation,
# breaking the build (MODULE_NOT_FOUND on inline-css.mjs) — never use !-rules here.
/research/agents/
/research/reports/
/research/vault/
/research/research/
/research/data/
/research/topics/
/research/*.py
/research/*.json
/research/*.sqlite*
docs/
scratch/
tests/
.git/
.github/
.agents/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
